+---
+id: "n_1007_f705"
+type: "note"
+title: "Running this repo's integration tests from INSIDE an fa agent session makes ~11 integration legs fail (backend_mode_cli, headless_tools_flag, yolo_rm_critical_e2e, headless_log_file): spawned `fa` sessions inherit the agent's FA_PROVIDERS_QUEUE / FA_LOG_FILE / FA_PROVIDER_CONFIG env and hit the real provider instead of the test's scripted one (timeouts, \"No element\", missing tool output). Fix when verifying: prefix with `env $(env | grep -oE \"^(FA|FAH)[A-Z_]*\" | sed 's/^/-u /') dart test ...`. Also pre-existing on this runner: test/browser_ext/ always fails (Chrome service worker needs DBus) and test/integration/composer_tui_grid_pty_test.dart \"grid integrity mid-run at 100x40\" is a render-timing flake — both fail on clean trees too (verify with `git worktree add /tmp/x <base>`)."
+author: "agent"
+date: "2026-10-21T22:12:41.201791Z"
+area: "project"
+topics: []
+source: "agent"
+accessCount: 0
+importance: 0.5
+tags: ["#note", "#source_agent", "testing", "integration", "flaky", "environment", "fa-harness"]
+---
+
+
+# Note: n_1007_f705
+
+Running this repo's integration tests from INSIDE an fa agent session makes ~11 integration legs fail (backend_mode_cli, headless_tools_flag, yolo_rm_critical_e2e, headless_log_file): spawned `fa` sessions inherit the agent's FA_PROVIDERS_QUEUE / FA_LOG_FILE / FA_PROVIDER_CONFIG env and hit the real provider instead of the test's scripted one (timeouts, "No element", missing tool output). Fix when verifying: prefix with `env $(env | grep -oE "^(FA|FAH)[A-Z_]*" | sed 's/^/-u /') dart test ...`. Also pre-existing on this runner: test/browser_ext/ always fails (Chrome service worker needs DBus) and test/integration/composer_tui_grid_pty_test.dart "grid integrity mid-run at 100x40" is a render-timing flake — both fail on clean trees too (verify with `git worktree add /tmp/x <base>`).
+
+**By:** [[agent]]
+**Date:** 2026-10-21T22:12:41.201791Z
+**Area:** [[project|project]]
